OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA day of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fscattered showers, some of which will
OL,7,Fbe heavy at times. Fresh to strong
OL,8,Fwinds, gusty around the coasts and
OL,9,Fhills. Showers and winds beginning to
OL,10,Fease by the evening. Feeling cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FWinds continuing to ease
OL,13,Fovernight to become light and variable
OL,14,Finto the early hours. A few isolated
OL,15,Fshowers at first, but becoming dry.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA fine and dry day on Sunday,
OL,18,Fwith light winds and patchy fair
OL,19,Fweather cloud developing through the
OL,20,Fday. Becoming cloudier overnight with
OL,21,Frain arriving later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
